      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Arcane magic is but a shard of the divine.</em><strong><br /></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Domain: </strong>Gain a wizard spell, or a sorcerer spell from the arcane bloodline, of up to your level as a bonus spell. You can switch out Intelligence or Charisma for Wisdom in the spell description.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells</strong>:<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Magic Spark, The Might of Magic, Shield of the Archons</p>"
